menu "AirGradient Local Server"

    config AG_LOCAL_SERVER_JSON_BUF
        int "Static scratch buffer for serialized GET payloads (bytes)"
        range 1024 16384
        default 3072
        help
            Size of the per-LocalServer static scratch buffer used to
            serialize GET /api/v1/measures and GET /api/v1/config payloads
            with cJSON_PrintPreallocated. The body is borrowed (zero-copy)
            by HttpResponse::body_static, so it must be large enough to hold
            the largest supported payload for the product.

endmenu
